  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "ERECTION OF A DOUBLE STOREY REAR EXTENSION AND CHANGE OF USE\r\nFROM C3 TO C4",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first floor rear extension by reason of its combined siting, height, depth and design results in an incongruous form of development that would disrupt the uniform first floor rear building line of the terrace row that it forms a part of to the detriment of the appearance of the terrace row.&amp;nbsp; The proposal is contrary to, in particular, policy D12.2, D12.3 and D12.4 of Merton Local Plan (2024).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development would result in the loss of a family sized unit thereby failing to comply with policy H11.1 of Merton Local Plan 2024.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first floor rear extension but reason of its combined height, depth and siting results in an overbearing and visually intrusive form of development that would adversely impact on outlook from the adjoining residents contrary to Policy D12.4 of Merton Local Plan (2024).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;By reason of absence of sufficient secure, integrated, convenient and accessible cycle parking facilities and absence of a s106 legal agreement to restrict access of future occupiers from obtaining residents parking permit, the scheme will impact the free flow of traffic in the locality to the detriment of highway and pedestrian safety and is contrary to, in particular, policy T16.2 of Merton&#x27;s Local Plan 2024 and T5 of the London Plan 2021.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
